#: idehelputilstrings.listheunitispartofthefpcsourcesbutthecorrespondingfpd
#, object-pascal-format
msgid "The unit %s is part of the FPC sources but the corresponding fpdoc xml file was not found.%sEither you have not yet added the fpcdocs directory to the search path or the unit is not yet documented.%sThe fpdoc files for the FPC sources can be downloaded from: %s%sPlease add the directory in the fpdoc editor options.%sIn order to create a new file the directory must be writable."
msgstr "Unit %s ແມ່ນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ FPC sources ແຕ່ບໍ່ພົບໄຟລ໌ fpdoc xml ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.%sທ່ານອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເພີ່ມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ fpcdocs ໃສ່ເສັ້ນທາງຄົ້ນຫາ ຫຼື unit ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກເອກະສານ.%sໄຟລ໌ fpdoc ສຳລັບ FPC sources ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດໄດ້ຈາກ: %s%sກະລຸນາເພີ່ມໄດເຣັກທໍຣີໃນຕົວເລືອກ fpdoc editor.%sເພື່ອສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຕ້ອງສາມາດຂຽນໄດ້."

